    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8fdb40ebb29d33810ad545",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠路线的最终战！\r\n漂亮地将菊之荣冠紧握于手中的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc023078035422f46ef52a81c77dc809d7084af996b5cee2f5afb47d4e295c94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
