    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1328f1c9ebff6a200d3ccb3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬！是爱慕织姬！！\r\n她的奔跑有如鬼魅，\r\n会场因她而充满欢呼！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6441648e7d973f09b987c07963f38033cda8bb73fcf658a5c528eeb74b8c05c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
