        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b44a527800d7c9672fd044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便是取得了『菊花赏』的胜利，\r\n爱慕织姬的模样也依旧那么奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90284149c6da54611785fdf40c6e08bde9facf7970582c1ed70d6f2cbb3c2f62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd0e46b4b00bb2892959243",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……一如先前那样，总是会一个人陷入沉思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b9fd29e38990f2326c59ba9c135dead7c9f201340fce3495d35c3eea6d853f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad266bbd906cb7f880a9b558",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『为了已故的妹妹献上无二的荣光』——\r\n这是她的目标。要是以这个目标考虑的话，\r\n可选的比赛有年末的『有马纪念』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c54ee1464b856e08fd8e861de0d56fc0b2e9606a90c7c091d100e615b803fc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082a7f42bff632e6431a9424",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……还是暂时放一放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "676fa74f6d2c54c71afab945dca5604ee2681e763826bc1e62183833bf800c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9439b16901018e04e4487122",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或者说，以春古马三冠为目标应该也不错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a46bbd2123b9cd76ab34257743e1f1c1e2dd8543c54f09b0be808eac1f1ec3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
