      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:308774415b82906da1c9bd54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许现在她需要先整理好自己的心情。\n为了她的『使命』，这样的休息也是必要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff796d5ddb2799b0a23532376c4e86fcae9b054be2ef21dc149c1b9ceecac63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76033a5b937013d88a180d03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后我决定将目标定在稍远一些的『宝冢纪念』。\r\n为了告诉她这一消息，我开始着手准备资料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d77dd3b87850bc80d50df5b7bbbd398122cb43f676a6778f7ea034f43aa6a91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
